WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.880
A small café in the morning. Ola would like a coffee.

2
00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:08.070
Przepraszam.

3
00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:12.140
Excuse me. She wants his attention.

4
00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:13.870
Proszę.

5
00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:17.660
It means please, when you ask for something.

6
00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:21.330
Proszę.

7
00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:26.200
It also means here you are when you hand something over.

8
00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:27.970
Dziękuję.

9
00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:29.540
Proszę.

10
00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:33.690
And you are welcome when someone thanks you.

11
00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:36.220
He offers her milk.

12
00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:37.810
Tak.

13
00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:39.860
And sugar?

14
00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:41.730
Nie.

15
00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:44.520
Proszę.

16
00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:48.200
Please, when you ask for something.

17
00:00:48.550 --> 00:00:51.470
Here you are, when you hand something over.

18
00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:55.300
You are welcome, when someone thanks you.

19
00:00:55.650 --> 00:01:00.970
One word, three uses. The situation tells you which.

20
00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:07.610
Tomek hands Ola her coffee. What does he say?

21
00:01:11.110 --> 00:01:12.030
Proszę.

22
00:01:12.830 --> 00:01:16.390
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

23
00:01:18.190 --> 00:01:19.110
Proszę.

24
00:01:21.110 --> 00:01:24.430
Ola takes the cup. What does she say?

25
00:01:27.930 --> 00:01:29.050
Dziękuję.

26
00:01:29.850 --> 00:01:33.410
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

27
00:01:35.210 --> 00:01:36.330
Dziękuję.

28
00:01:38.630 --> 00:01:43.230
Later, in the street. Tomek holds the door open.

29
00:01:43.980 --> 00:01:45.500
Dziękuję bardzo.

30
00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:47.070
Proszę.

31
00:01:48.820 --> 00:01:50.060
Przepraszam.

32
00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:56.130
Same words, a different place. And it can also mean: sorry.

33
00:01:57.880 --> 00:02:02.520
Tomek has his back to her. How does Ola get his attention?

34
00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:07.260
Przepraszam.

35
00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:11.620
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

36
00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:14.660
Przepraszam.

37
00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:20.900
He offers milk, and she wants some. What does she say?

38
00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:25.240
Tak.

39
00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:29.600
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

40
00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:32.240
Tak.

41
00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:38.560
Now practise these words with the exercises below the video.
